    {
      "id": "lcg_spanish_a1_d02_c001",
      "deckId": "lcg_spanish_a1_d02",
      "type": "RICH_TEXT",
      "front": "<h3>ser 与 estar</h3><p><strong>ser</strong> 表示<strong>本质、身份、来源</strong>；<strong>estar</strong> 表示<strong>状态、位置</strong>。</p>",
      "back": "<p>例：<i>Soy</i> estudiante.（身份）<br><i>Estoy</i> cansado.（状态）</p>",
      "title": "ser 与 estar 的核心区别",
      "tags": ["语法", "系动词", "A1"],
      "metadata": {
        "hcenter": "true",
        "vcenter": "true"
      },
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T08:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-03T08:00:00.000Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lcg_spanish_a1_d02_c002",
      "deckId": "lcg_spanish_a1_d02",
      "type": "MARKDOWN",
      "front": "## ser 与 estar 对比\n\n| 动词 | 用法 | 例子 |\n|---|---|---|\n| ser | 身份、来源、本质 | Soy chino. |\n| estar | 状态、位置 | Estoy en casa. |",
      "back": "记住：**ser** 回答「是谁/是什么」，**estar** 回答「现在怎样/在哪里」。",
      "title": "ser 与 estar 对比表",
      "tags": ["语法", "系动词", "A1"],
      "metadata": {},
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T08:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-03T08:00:00.000Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lcg_spanish_a1_d02_c003",
      "deckId": "lcg_spanish_a1_d02",
      "type": "BASIC",
      "front": "为什么说「Estoy cansado」而不是「Soy cansado」？",
      "back": "因为「累」是暂时的状态，不是永久身份；描述状态用 estar。若用 ser，会被理解为「我是一个疲惫的人」这种本质描述，语义不自然。",
      "title": "疲惫状态为什么用 estar",
      "tags": ["语法", "系动词", "易错点"],
      "metadata": {
        "fontSize": "16"
      },
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T08:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-03T08:00:00.000Z",
